  "description": "Channel the flavours of the Caribbean into a hearty soup brimming with chickpeas, creamy coconut milk and\nroasted root veggies. Zingy lemon and mild Caribbean spices bring the tropical vibes, while the roasted sweetcorn\nadds a sweet and toasty depth of flavour. \nThe current labour\nshortages have impacted\navailability of ingredients\nacross the entire food\nsupply chain. As such,\nwhat you receive may\nbe slightly different to\nwhat’s pictured. Don’t\nworry, your recipe will be\njust as delicious!",
