  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Preheat oven to 220°C/200°C fan-forced. Cut sweet potato and carrot into small chunks. Drain sweetcorn.\n• Place sweet potato, carrot and corn on a lined oven tray. Drizzle with olive oil, season with salt and pepper and toss to coat.\n• Roast until tender, 20-25 minutes. TIP: If your oven tray is crowded, divide the veggies between two trays.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6242c6df85c2362741696531/step-fa60a684.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• While the veggies are roasting, finely chop garlic. Cut lemon into wedges. Drain and rinse chickpeas.\n• In a large saucepan, heat a drizzle of olive oil over medium-high heat. Cook garlic and mild Caribbean jerk seasoning, stirring, until fragrant, 1-2 minutes.\n• Stir through diced tomatoes with garlic & onion, coconut milk and vegetable stock powder.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6242c6df85c2362741696531/step-fd227302.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Add chickpeas to the soup. Bring to a simmer. Cook until slightly thickened, 6-10 minutes.\n• Stir though roasted veggies and mixed leaves. Season to taste.\n• Add a squeeze of lemon juice to taste. TIP: Stir through a splash of water if you prefer a thinner soup.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6242c6df85c2362741696531/step-4b82437b.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Thinly slice fresh chilli (if using).\n• Divide Caribbean chickpea and coconut soup between bowls. Sprinkle with chilli. Tear over herb leaves.\n• Serve with any remaining lemon wedges.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6242c6df85c2362741696531/step-7c0bbec3.jpg"
    }
  ]
